WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.286
The squire's daughters, Jessie and Flora, liked to play with all the children in the neighborhood.

2
00:00:08.287 --> 00:00:13.277
The other children loved Merrylegs just as much as the girls did.

3
00:00:13.278 --> 00:00:22.007
The cheerful gray pony often spent hours giving them all rides in the orchard or up and down the drive.

4
00:00:22.008 --> 00:00:26.060
One afternoon he spent an especially long time with them.

5
00:00:26.061 --> 00:00:30.986
Finally James led Merrylegs back into the stable.

6
00:00:30.987 --> 00:00:38.778
"There you go, you little rascal," the groom said with a chuckle as he pulled off the pony's saddle and bridle.

7
00:00:38.779 --> 00:00:42.168
"You'd better behave yourself better next time.

8
00:00:42.169 --> 00:00:46.272
Otherwise we will both get in deep trouble."

9
00:00:46.273 --> 00:00:50.344
When the young man had left, I looked into the pony's stall.

10
00:00:50.345 --> 00:00:53.837
"What have you been doing, Merrylegs?" I asked him.

11
00:00:53.838 --> 00:01:00.097
Merrylegs tossed his pretty little head. "Nothing much," he said.

12
00:01:00.098 --> 00:01:04.587
"Just teaching some young humans a lesson, that's all."

13
00:01:04.588 --> 00:01:08.491
Ginger looked up from the rack where she stood eating hay.

14
00:01:08.492 --> 00:01:11.461
"What do you mean?" she asked.

15
00:01:11.462 --> 00:01:14.559
"They couldn't tell when I'd had enough," he said.

16
00:01:14.560 --> 00:01:17.342
So I tossed them off backward.

17
00:01:17.343 --> 00:01:21.037
That was the only way to make them understand."

18
00:01:21.038 --> 00:01:28.367
"What?" I cried. "Are you saying you threw off Miss Jessie or Miss Flora?"

19
00:01:28.368 --> 00:01:34.994
"Of course not!" Merrylegs looked offended. "I would never do that.

20
00:01:34.995 --> 00:01:39.599
I take better care of those young ladies than their own parents do!

21
00:01:39.600 --> 00:01:47.299
And I'm always patient with the smaller children, no matter how much they squeal or bounce on my back.

22
00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:51.039
I'm the one who teaches them all to ride."

23
00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:55.385
"Yes, that's what everyone says," I said.

24
00:01:55.386 --> 00:02:00.670
"It was the older boys who needed the lesson this time," Merrylegs went on.

25
00:02:00.671 --> 00:02:07.912
"In case you don't know, boys need to be trained as much as we horses do when we're colts.

26
00:02:07.913 --> 00:02:11.111
They need to be taught what's right."

27
00:02:11.112 --> 00:02:14.885
"I see," I said. "But what happened?"

28
00:02:14.886 --> 00:02:19.379
"I'm trying to tell you!" Merrylegs tossed his head again.

29
00:02:19.380 --> 00:02:23.886
"The other children rode me for a couple of hours, as usual.

30
00:02:23.887 --> 00:02:28.415
Finally the older boys decided it was their turn.

31
00:02:28.416 --> 00:02:31.960
"At first I had no problem with that.

32
00:02:31.961 --> 00:02:41.339
I carried them around one at a time, galloping through the fields and orchard just as they wished.

33
00:02:41.340 --> 00:02:44.930
This went on for at least another hour."

34
00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:49.265
"You must have been tired by then," Ginger said.

35
00:02:49.266 --> 00:02:54.250
"A little," Merrylegs said. "But I know my job.

36
00:02:54.251 --> 00:03:01.205
And I was happy to do it, even though the boys had made a whip out of a large twig they found.

37
00:03:01.206 --> 00:03:06.125
They used it a bit too much, but I put up with it for a while.

38
00:03:06.126 --> 00:03:12.081
They ran me around and around as fast as I could go, whipping me all the way.

39
00:03:12.082 --> 00:03:16.196
"Finally, though, I decided I'd had enough.

40
00:03:16.197 --> 00:03:19.296
So I stopped a few times to give them the hint.

41
00:03:19.297 --> 00:03:23.166
But all they did was whip me even more!"

42
00:03:23.167 --> 00:03:25.636
"Oh dear!" I said.

43
00:03:25.637 --> 00:03:35.641
"Those silly boys never stopped to think that a pony can get tired, or have any feelings at all," Merrylegs said.

44
00:03:35.642 --> 00:03:39.219
"They treated me like an old bicycle.

45
00:03:39.220 --> 00:03:45.534
Finally I decided it was time to help them understand it was wrong.

46
00:03:45.535 --> 00:03:53.986
So I stood up on my hind legs just enough to tip my rider off over my hind end. That's all."

47
00:03:53.987 --> 00:03:57.696
"Did they understand then?" I asked.

48
00:03:57.697 --> 00:04:01.479
"Not at first," Merrylegs said calmly.

49
00:04:01.480 --> 00:04:06.001
"I had to tip each of the boys off a few more times.

50
00:04:06.002 --> 00:04:11.133
But finally they began to catch on.

51
00:04:11.134 --> 00:04:16.819
And when they brought me to James and complained, he was annoyed to see their homemade whip.

52
00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:21.912
He said they didn't need anything like that to ride me."

53
00:04:21.913 --> 00:04:24.222
Ginger tossed her head.

54
00:04:24.223 --> 00:04:28.295
"If they'd tried any of that with me, I would have given them a good kick."

55
00:04:28.296 --> 00:04:32.306
"I'm sure you would have," Merrylegs said.

56
00:04:32.307 --> 00:04:38.117
"But that's because you've never been in a place that treated you kindly until now.

57
00:04:38.118 --> 00:04:41.144
Anyway, I'm not like you.

58
00:04:41.145 --> 00:04:45.964
That's why the squire trusts me so completely with the little girls.

59
00:04:45.965 --> 00:04:52.046
The other parents trust me too. They know I would never hurt their children.

60
00:04:52.047 --> 00:04:58.556
Besides, those boys are not bad boys. They don't mean to be cruel.

61
00:04:58.557 --> 00:05:02.512
They only needed a lesson, that's all."

62
00:05:02.513 --> 00:05:06.709
"I suppose it's your job to teach them," I said thoughtfully.

63
00:05:06.710 --> 00:05:12.841
"Yes, it is," Merrylegs agreed. "And I want to do a good job.

64
00:05:12.842 --> 00:05:20.514
The people here have treated me kindly for the past five years, and I would never do anything to make them angry.

65
00:05:20.515 --> 00:05:26.709
If I suddenly started kicking children for acting like children, where would I be?

66
00:05:26.710 --> 00:05:32.400
Sold off in a hurry, that's where! And none of us want that."

67
00:05:32.401 --> 00:05:35.576
I supposed that Merrylegs was right about that.

68
00:05:35.577 --> 00:05:38.784
None of us wanted to be sold to another owner.

69
00:05:38.785 --> 00:05:47.586
We were all happy at Birtwick Park—even Ginger—and hoped that we could stay there forever.

